          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba kukhona emzimbeni inxeba elenziwa yikutshiswa, lenyama ebomvu iphendukile yaba libala elimhlophe loba ibala elimhlophe lelibomvana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umpristi kalihlole; uba uboya obukhona buphendukile baba mhlophe, libonakala ukuthi litshonile, kuyibulephero; buvele enxebeni elenziwa yikutshiswa; umpristi uzakutsho ukuthi ungcolile, ngoba kuyibulephero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba umpristi ebona ukuthi uboya obukhona kabumhlophe, lokuthi kalitshonanga kodwa lifiphele, umpristi uzamvalela insuku eziyisikhombisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku lwesikhombisa umpristi uzakumhlola; uba lisanda emzimbeni, umpristi uzakutsho ukuthi ungcolile, ngoba kuyibulephero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba ibala limi endaweni yalo, lingandi emzimbeni, kodwa lifiphele, kulinxeba elenziwa yikutshiswa; umpristi atsho ukuthi uhlambulukile, ngoba kulinxeba lokutshiswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
