          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lowo ngumlayo omayelana lesibhadlu sokubola esisengutsheni yoboya bemvu, loba engutsheni yelembu elihle, loba elenjini elalukiweyo, loba entweni yesikhumba, okuzabonwa ngawo ukuthi kuhlambulukile ingabe kungcolile.",
          "type": "text",
